<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  A play triangle built from five sharp white rays that fan out to the tip:
  video playback made from caption lines. A soft drop shadow and a top-down
  sheen make the rays read as raised strips. Foreground for the adaptive
  launcher icon, kept inside the circular safe zone and shifted slightly right
  so its visual weight sits in the middle of the icon mask.
-->
